         blurb='Can you steam your face before glutathione cream? Only gently: a few minutes of warm (not hot) steam, then wait for skin to cool before a thin layer of cream. Why steam does not make a cream work better, who should skip it, and the night-only retinol rule.',
         seo='Face Steaming with Glutathione Cream: Safe Way to Do It',
